Kidstoria – is a collection of personal tales for your child. Your child is the main hero of the adventures. Just type in the name and the gender, so each book becomes a personal tale for your daughter or son. 

Kidstoria – it’s time for you and your child. 

Our fairy tales are written with love by our children's writers, and our illustrations are made by the handpicked artists. 

The most popular stories for kids:

- “Where a smile lives”: a story about a baby fox who lost their smile and went looking for it;
- “Sea dreaming“: This story will tell you how vital it is to chase your dreams and how meaningful they are;
- “The Snowmen factory“: how to bravely overcome fears to become happier;
- “The land of abandoned toys”: is about a child’s love of cleaning up;
- “Why do the stars shine”: is about a period when a child explores the universe and asks a thousand questions “why”.
- New stories each month;
- Original and beautiful illustrations;
- Short, fascinating and instructive stories.

Your child will love being the main character of the fairy tales.

New stories will be uploaded regularly. Stay tuned for updates.  

